definition:
The term "socialist" is used to describe a government that has:

a) a central government;

b) a single government;

c) a central government and a single government;

d) a single government and a single government.

The word "zeal" is used in a sentence about:

(a) a person who is highly motivated to do something;

(b) a person who is motivated to do something;

(c) a person who is motivated to do something.
